00:16:46,220 --> 00:16:50,740
Since the prize for this competition
is so desirable, I was hoping Apu,

255
00:16:51,020 --> 00:16:53,640
or Kid, or at least one
of them would enter.

256
00:16:55,060 --> 00:16:57,707
But I'm not even sure
I'd know if I saw them.

257
00:16:58,600 --> 00:16:59,430
Who knows?

258
00:16:59,780 --> 00:17:03,604
Any of them could have concealed
their faces the way Burgess did.

259
00:17:03,700 --> 00:17:05,229
And what if I do see them?

260
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:08,164
Do I wait for them to
move on to the next round?

261
00:17:09,980 --> 00:17:10,810
Pardon me.

262
00:17:10,960 --> 00:17:14,254
Is it all right if I watch
the fight with you gentlemen?

263
00:17:20,120 --> 00:17:22,944
Hmm, we have a good view
of the fight from here.

264
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:25,560
How's old Garp doing these days?

265
00:17:26,100 --> 00:17:27,860
Tell me, Luffy.

266
00:17:29,360 --> 00:17:32,180
Hey, you mean you know my grandpa? You!

267
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:35,680
Know him? Sure.

268
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:38,280
Years ago, he nearly killed me.

269
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:44,280
And now I carry that grudge against him,
his children, and his grandchildren.

270
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:49,970
You
